    "module": {
      "summary": "Scottish Statutory Instrument 2021/249 regulation 71 — notional capital\nfor Scottish Council Tax Reduction.\n\nWhere an applicant has disposed of capital for the purpose of securing or\nincreasing entitlement to a reduction, the amount disposed of is treated\nas notional capital, except to the extent the disposal was for paying\ndebts or reasonable purchases. This RuleSpec module sums qualifying disposals\nusing the `sum_where` / `count_where` filtered-aggregation extension;\neach Disposal record carries an input flag `is_qualifying_disposal`\npre-computed by the caller from the statutory purpose and reason tests."
    },
